  id: thunder725sMusicalAdventures
  title: thunder725's Musical Adventures
  author: thunder725
  description: 'Missions straight from the weird parts of my brain.


    Missions in "Section 2: Shuffled Playlist" must be played with the Rule Seed Modifier
    mod enabled and a random Rule Seed.

    The bombs will not launch without the Rule Seed Modifier mod installed and enabled.

    Trying to play with the Random Rule Seed setting set to false will instantly explode
    the bomb on startup.



    =-= Current Mission List:


    = Section 1: Greatest Hits

    - 1.1: Good Morning, 47

    - 1.2: Zero-Way Mirror


    = Section 2: Shuffled Playlists

    - 2.1: Played by Ear'
